<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tekelec estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tekelec estimates raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial said Thursday it raised its earnings per share estimates on Tekelec for fiscal 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1997 estimate to $0.82 per share from $0.79.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $1.15 per share from $1.10.</p>
<p>-- Kept short- and long-term ratings at buy.</p>
<p>-- Tekelec late Wednesday reported second quarter earnings of $0.24 per share, reversing a year-ago loss of $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 7-3/4 to 54-1/2.</p>
</text>
